# Balloon on a bottle: gas needs somewhere to go
# A piston lid represents a flexible balloon: it computes pressure and expanding
# volume, not rubber elasticity, balloon shape or latex failure.
register lv2
add v1 white_vinegar_5_percent 50mL
seal v1 500mL
add v1 baking_soda 5g
measure v1 pressure
measure v1 volume
regulate v1 1bar 500mL
measure v1 pressure
measure v1 volume
